siest thing in the world."], [39.2, 40.5, "Now I'm not waking up blocked,"], [40.74, 42.72, "reaching for tissues before my feet hit the floor."], [43.12, 44.1, "I've got my mornings back."], [44.6, 46.5, "I stocked up on the Black Friday sale hit,"], [46.78, 49.3, "up to 12 free cards, up to 79% off."], [49.58, 51.56, "They only run it until November 29th"], [51.56, 53.32, "and last time it sold out fast."]]}